      },
      "message": "fix(deburr): refuse start and exit on one chain while other chains remain\n\nA start pick and an exit pick on the same edge chain made that chain\nfirst and last. With other chains present, the operation then ended on\nanother chain: the exit was silently moved. Refuse that combination by\nname before any motion. Pinned by\nsame_chain_picks_with_another_chain_must_keep_the_exit_or_refuse_it.\n\nRefs #3329\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
